# ---------------- PhysTarget.events (physics movement test) ----------------
# Setup: EventSheet on the PhysTarget actor (mesh root), "Use Physics Movement" OFF.
# It needs a solid BoxCollider child; the bullet's trigger collider reports the hit.

when me appears
  set my Hits to 0
  set text of HitsLabel to my Hits

when message "hit" arrives
  add 1 to my Hits
  hide me
  wait 0.15 seconds
  show me

when my Hits changes
  set text of HitsLabel to my Hits
